WHAT NoporIS IS / IS NOT (for attribution purposes)
---------------------------------------------------
- NoporIS is an UNPRIVILEGED APP on stock, user-supplied Android. It is NEVER
  "Postern OS" and is not an Android distribution.
- NoporIS ships NO operating system, NO AOSP source, and NO Google Mobile
  Services (GMS). It compiles AGAINST the Android SDK; it does not incorporate
  AOSP source into its binary. The user brings their own device, OS, and Google
  account. GMS, where present, is the user's own — obtained from their device
  manufacturer under Google's terms, not redistributed by NoporIS.
- "Android", "Google", "Google Play", the Android robot, and the Google Play
  logo are trademarks of Google LLC, used here ONLY NOMINATIVELY to identify the
  Google products NoporIS interoperates with. NoporIS is independent and is not
  endorsed by, certified by, or affiliated with Google or the AOSP project.

